    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG McCormack Properties are delighted to present 11 Central Park to the market for sale.\n\nThis spacious 3-bedroom semi-detached property is ideally located within a charming, picturesque residential development, just a short walk from Clane village. The property offers bright, well-proportioned living accommodation throughout and would make an ideal home for first-time buyers, families or investors.\n\nThe accommodation comprises an extended open-plan kitchen/dining room, comfortable sitting room, three generously sized bedrooms and a family bathroom.\n\nExternally, the property is equally impressive, featuring large off-street parking and a convenient side entrance leading to a private, low-maintenance rear garden. The garden benefits from a large new patio area and extensive paving, as well as security lighting. The rear garden is also not overlooked, providing an excellent level of privacy.\n\nCentral Park is superbly located in Clane, within easy walking distance of the village centre and all the amenities the area has to offer.\n\nClane has a thriving Main Street with a wide selection of shops, pubs and cafés, while major supermarkets including Lidl, Dunnes Stores, Tesco and Aldi are all available locally. The beautiful walking routes along the River Liffey are also just a short stroll away.\n\nThe area is well served by a number of primary and secondary schools, as well as pre-school facilities, making it an excellent choice for families.\n\nFor commuters, Clane offers convenient access to both the N4 and N7, which are approximately 15 minutes' drive away. There are regular bus services to Naas and Maynooth, while Dublin Bus also provides services to Dublin city centre. Sallins train station is approximately a 10-minute drive away, providing rail connections to Dublin and beyond.\n\nThis property is sure to appeal to a wide range of buyers and viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate what this excellent home has to offer.\n\nContact DNG McCormack Properties today to arrange a viewing on 045 832 535."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - 1.92m x 4.02m\nTimber flooring, understairs storage unit\n\nLiving Room - 3.76m x 4.03m\nTimber flooring, insert solid fuel stove in marble fireplace, custom made tv entertainment unit with extensive bookshelves and storage, coving\n\nKitchen/ Dining Room/ Family Room - 311.36m x 8.39m\nTimber flooring, fully fitted kitchen units at floor and eye level, breakfast bar, double doors to rear, large bright and welcoming space\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.41m x 3.45m\nCarpeted flooring, array of floor to ceiling built in wardrobes with vanity area, large room, front aspect\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.70m x 3.43m\nCarpeted flooring, rear aspect, large spacious room\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.23m x 2.14m\nCarpeted flooring, front aspect, ideal as home office\n\nBathroom - 2.00m x 1.65m\nCeramic tiled floor and shower area, WC, WHB, bath with Triton electric shower over\n\n"
      },
